&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;mint prepare-dpo&lt;/code&gt;: Prepares preference pairs (chosen vs. rejected responses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;mint download-climbmix&lt;/code&gt;: Downloads and tokenizes curated reasoning and code pre-training datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
